{"3904850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Approximately Up", "steam_appid": 3904850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Approximately Up</i> is your best chance to experience spaceflight in whatever you and your crew (singleplayer or <strong>co-op multiplayer with up to 4 players</strong>) can bolt together! Build epic spaceships or barely flying trashcans — it’s entirely up to you. Control your creation from a <strong>first-person view right from the deck of your ship</strong>. Complete challenging objectives, hunt achievements, face the dangers of space, and collect new components to expand your current spacecraft — or build hundreds of new ones. One is never enough!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Build spaceships!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything begins with a single piece of frame and grows into a massive, complex ship built from thousands of components. Create automated systems, experiment with different input controllers, sensors, and meters — connect them to whatever you need, and let the magic (or chaos) happen! Once it looks ready (or not), hit launch and see what happens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/eb5a69329fb512df1584b88025dc1992.poster.avif?t=1788255956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/eb5a69329fb512df1584b88025dc1992.webm?t=1788255956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Complete challenging objectives!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimental power sources that need to be delivered to a station on another planet — causing unexpected power outages mid-flight? Some strange energy crystal charging up like a ticking time bomb? Or maybe it’s just a massive, ridiculously heavy submarine this time? Can your spaceship handle that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/173fd414913bf6f033b7946a9fad32b5.poster.avif?t=1788255956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/173fd414913bf6f033b7946a9fad32b5.webm?t=1788255956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore the new planets!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the planet covered in oceans? What’s hiding beneath that thick atmosphere? Can you see the surface through those massive clouds? Everything’s waiting for you to find out! Explore <strong>15 unique planets</strong>, each with its own look, feel, and <strong>dynamic soundtrack</strong> that changes in real time as you explore and make new discoveries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/2b3afe78436e1af53128a310d272eec8.poster.avif?t=1788255956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/2b3afe78436e1af53128a310d272eec8.webm?t=1788255956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Blame each other!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who forgot to connect that cable? Who mounted the thruster backward? Who forgot the solar panels? Or the door-opening button? Is the radar working? How about the batteries? Enjoy the hilarious chaos in <strong>co-op multiplayer</strong> with up to 4 players — and find out once and for all... WHOSE FAULT WAS IT?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/0b5370a3bef0f17fdf3ec572a476666d.poster.avif?t=1788255956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/0b5370a3bef0f17fdf3ec572a476666d.webm?t=1788255956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>So how does it works?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start on <strong>Earth</strong> and slowly explore a system of <strong>15 planets</strong>, each with its own size, gravity, atmosphere, temperature, and challenges that make every world feel different. Most planets have one or more <strong>Planet Stations</strong>, which work as checkpoints and garages where you can build ships and start new missions. When you land on a station, it unlocks permanently and becomes a new place you can launch from. To reach these planets, you build your own <strong>modular spaceships</strong> and experiment with different parts - electric engines, fuel engines, mixed fuels, solar panels, heat-resistant frames, and more. By <strong>completing missions</strong> like delivering components between planets, you earn <strong>new ship parts</strong> that let you create better and more advanced designs. All flights are fully <strong>first-person</strong> from inside your craft, and because distances are huge, your <strong>ship design really matters</strong> - some trips will take only <strong>minutes</strong>, while others can turn into <strong>long journeys</strong> if your ship is weak. The whole game is about exploring planets, upgrading your ships, unlocking new stations, and trying to make it to your destination without crashing.<br><br><br><i><strong>Note: Demo currently supports English only. Additional languages will be available in the full release.</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p clas