toplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/173fd414913bf6f033b7946a9fad32b5.poster.avif?t=1788255956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/173fd414913bf6f033b7946a9fad32b5.webm?t=1788255956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore the new planets!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the planet covered in oceans? What’s hiding beneath that thick atmosphere? Can you see the surface through those massive clouds? Everything’s waiting for you to find out! Explore <strong>15 unique planets</strong>, each with its own look, feel, and <strong>dynamic soundtrack</strong> that changes in real time as you explore and make new discoveries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/2b3afe78436e1af53128a310d272eec8.poster.avif?t=1788255956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/2b3afe78436e1af53128a310d272eec8.webm?t=1788255956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Blame each other!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who forgot to connect that cable? Who mounted the thruster backward? Who forgot the solar panels? Or the door-opening button? Is the radar working? How about the batteries? Enjoy the hilarious chaos in <strong>co-op multiplayer</strong> with up to 4 players — and find out once and for all... WHOSE FAULT WAS IT?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/0b5370a3bef0f17fdf3ec572a476666d.poster.avif?t=1788255956\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/extras/0b5370a3bef0f17fdf3ec572a476666d.webm?t=1788255956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>So how does it works?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start on <strong>Earth</strong> and slowly explore a system of <strong>15 planets</strong>, each with its own size, gravity, atmosphere, temperature, and challenges that make every world feel different. Most planets have one or more <strong>Planet Stations</strong>, which work as checkpoints and garages where you can build ships and start new missions. When you land on a station, it unlocks permanently and becomes a new place you can launch from. To reach these planets, you build your own <strong>modular spaceships</strong> and experiment with different parts - electric engines, fuel engines, mixed fuels, solar panels, heat-resistant frames, and more. By <strong>completing missions</strong> like delivering components between planets, you earn <strong>new ship parts</strong> that let you create better and more advanced designs. All flights are fully <strong>first-person</strong> from inside your craft, and because distances are huge, your <strong>ship design really matters</strong> - some trips will take only <strong>minutes</strong>, while others can turn into <strong>long journeys</strong> if your ship is weak. The whole game is about exploring planets, upgrading your ships, unlocking new stations, and trying to make it to your destination without crashing.<br><br><br><i><strong>Note: Demo currently supports English only. Additional languages will be available in the full release.</strong></i></p>", "short_description": "Build, crash, rebuild! Explore new planets in co-op multiplayer with your fully modular spaceship made from whatever bolts together long enough to fly. Mount giant thrusters, annoying cables, and everything in between. Complete wild missions, face the dangers of space and argue with your crew!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Polish, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/d91f2e97c92cb98f97b3c773ff1e2d84bf6bc127/header.jpg?t=1788255956", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/85486616ba65b3483fb27f09bbcaa80bede89d97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788255956", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904850/85486616ba65b3483fb27f09bbcaa80bede89d97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788255956", "website": "https://www.approximatelyup.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5GHz 6-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3060 or Radeon RX 6700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements":